OL,3,GNEWSA'It was a joy to teach US comedian
OL,4,Ayoga'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yoga teacher says it was "a joy" but
OL,7,F"surreal" to give a lesson to a
OL,8,Fcomedian she had booked to see perform
OL,9,Fthat night.
OL,11,FGosia Federowicz, who lives in
OL,12,FHarborne, Birmingham, reached out to
OL,13,Fstand-up Gianmarco Soresi on Instagram
OL,14,Fafter booking tickets to see him live,
OL,15,Fto see if he wanted any local
OL,16,Frecommendations.
OL,18,FShe was surprised and excited when the
OL,19,FAmerican performer and seasoned yogee
OL,20,Fbooked in with her for a private lesson
OL,21,Fbefore he played Birmingham Town Hall
OL,22,Fon 30 September.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
